<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Australia by four wickets in their World Series Cup limited overs match at the WACA ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 267-7 (50 overs), West Indies  269-6 (49.2).</p>
